    173  1296							; SMART CHORD / EXTENSIONS: each held note becomes a chord built in the key.
    174  1296							; A note in the scale gets its diatonic chord (stacked scale thirds: triad,
    175  1296							; or 7 / 9 / 11 / 13 with extensions). A note outside the scale gets a
    176  1296							; major triad (+ b7, 9, 11, 13). Results merge, ascending, at most 8.
    177  1296				   Expand
    178  1296					      subroutine
    179  1296		       ae 01 c3 	      ldx	heldCount
